# The trading environment (.venv): what the desk's jobs and their tests import. Every pin is the one the desk ran
# with inside trading-lab-research at 217a4eb (its requirements.lock.txt), so the numbers it computes are the same.
# Compile with (the constraint file is that lockfile: it holds the transitive pins to the same versions):
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes -c <trading-lab-research>/requirements.lock.txt \
#     requirements.in -o requirements.lock.txt
